OL,3,GNEWSAFemale Airfix staff 'harassed' at
OL,4,Ascale model event
OL,5,
OL,6,FWomen working for scale model firm
OL,7,FAirfix at an event in Telford were
OL,8,Fsubjected to "sexist, misogynistic,
OL,9,Fracist and degrading comments",
OL,10,Forganisers have said.
OL,12,FIt followed the Scale ModelWorld event
OL,13,Fat the Telford International Centre on
OL,14,F7 and 8 November.
OL,16,FIn a joint statement, International
OL,17,FPlastic Modellers' Society (IPMS) and
OL,18,FAirfix, which are investigating, said
OL,19,Fthe women were targeted at the event
OL,20,Fitself, as well as on social media
OL,21,Fafterwards, saying it amounted to
OL,22,F"harassment".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
